SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Section 90\, Physician Services: Retroactive 
 Rate Update Effective January 1\, 2026\, CR#142205\, 142218
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Section 90\, Physician Services: Retroactive Rate Updat
 e Effective January 1\, 2026\, CR#142205\, 142218\nSection 90\, Physician 
 Services: Retroactive Rate Update Effective January 1\, 2026\, CR#142205\,
  142218\nSep 02\, 2026\nMaineCare updated certain physician service rates
  retroactively to January 1\, 2026\, due to a recent rate update from 
 the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services (CMS). The new rates reflec
 t 72.4% of the Maine Medicare rates and were implemented for billing on A
 ugust 26\, 2026.\nCR 142205\nCode\nOld Rate\nNew Rate\n15011\n$165.50\n$18
 3.24\n15011\n$76.90\nFacility\n15012\n$138.19\n$183.24\n15012\n$76.90\nFac
 ility\n15013\n$102.11\n$57.46\n15013\n$48.12\nFacility\n15014\n$59.48\n$57
 .46\n15014\n$48.12\nFacility\n15015\n$361.26\n$508.57\n15015\n$411.13\nFac
 ility\n15016\n$96.09\n$83.60\n15016\n$65.13\nFacility\n15017\n$515.59\n$57
 1.03\n15017\n$443.56\nFacility\n15018\n$95.77\n$112.42\n15018\n$89.95\nFac
 ility\nCR 142218\nCode\nOld Rate\nNew Rate\n22554\n$801.54\n$801.39\n26562
 \n$879\n$878.86\n33269\n532.36\n$532.21\n33464\n1522.88\n$1\,522.72\n33983
 \n1405.72\n$1\,405.57\n35221\n894.69\n$894.54\n37660\n813.31\n$813.15\n443
 22\n655.32\n$655.17\n58290\n687.1\n$686.95\n60271\n638.73\n$638.58\n61320\
 n1195.21\n$1\,195.06\n64804\n781.94\n$781.79\nAdjustment Billing Guidance 
 for Dates of Service January 1\, 2026 - August 25\, 2026\nMaineCare wi
 ll adjust paid claims submitted with charges\nat or above\nthe new rat
 es.\nProviders are responsible for adjusting claims submitted with cha
 rges\nbelow\nthe new rates\, as deemed appropriate by the provider. Per
  policy\, and to avoid timely filing denials\, adjustments must be subm
 itted within 120 days of the most recent claim payment date.\nFor questio
 ns\, please contact your\nProvider Relations Specialist\n.\nhttps://www.m
 aine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/section-90-physician-servic
 es-retroactive-rate-update-effective-january-1-2026-cr142205
