SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] MaineCare in Education: Updated Joint Individ
 ual Education Program (IEP) Guidance for School Health-Related Services
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			MaineCare in Education: Updated Joint Individual Educat
 ion Program (IEP) Guidance for School Health-Related Services\nMaineCare i
 n Education: Updated Joint Individual Education Program (IEP) Guidance for
  School Health-Related Services\nAug 31\, 2026\nAs a reminder\, all provid
 ers who deliver services following the Individuals with Disabilities Educa
 tion Act (IDEA) must ensure all MaineCare-covered services are documented 
 following the Department of Health and Human Services/Maine Department of 
 Education Joint IEP Guidance document.\nThe Maine Department of Educatio
 n has released\nupdated Joint IEP Guidance\nto help schools follow federal
  and state requirements. The updated guidance was developed through a coll
 aborative effort and is available on the\nMaineCare in Education web page\
 n.\nAll IEP documents must reflect the updated guidance as soon as possibl
 e\,\nbut no later than thirty (30) days of the issuance of the guidance\n.
  Providers with current prior authorizations for School Health-Related Ser
 vices through Acentra should upload any updated documentation to Atrezzo.\
 nFor technical assistance regarding the billing and processing of MaineCar
 e claims\, please contact your\nProvider Relations Specialist\n.\nFor all 
 other questions related to the provision of MaineCare School Health-Relate
 d Services\, please contact\nTrista Collins\n\, State Medicaid Educational
  Liaison.\nFor technical information related to IEP development\, please c
 ontact\nDan Hemdal\nat the Maine Department of Education.\nhttps://www.mai
 ne.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/mainecare-education-updated-j
 oint-individual-education-program-iep-guidance-school-health
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/mainecare-
 education-updated-joint-individual-education-program-iep-guidance-school-h
 ealth
